SWEET nav: home swipe after every unlock (patch 0405, oriole speed round 2026-11-19; follow-up of 0255). On the oriole root iOS resumes the user's last app (Safari) at the unlock: the 0403 'home' thumbnail of run speed-free (right before the settings-open tap of repetition 0) shows Safari's black page and toolbar, not the home screen, so the whole rep 0 (and the probe of every rep) ran inside Safari. Patch 0255 ends the unlock row with the calibrated app-home swipe only when Preferences exec'd in the unlock window; boot-arg sweetnavhome=1 (default 0 = unchanged) does it after every unlock, with its own log line. Input injection only (the same 540,2398 -> 1200 swipe), no register.
